            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Inter alia, a method is disclosed. The method comprises detecting, by a microphone of a first electronic device of multiple electronic devices, a voice input; determining, by one or more processors, a first quality score for the voice input; determining, based at least in part on the first quality score and one or more second quality scores associated with one or more other electronic devices of the multiple electronic devices, that the electronic device is a leader device; and outputting, by the electronic device, a response to the voice input. Also disclosed are a system and a non-transitory computer-readable medium.</p>
            </abstract>
